  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/868/291/7.png\" alt=\"ariose\" width=\"1023\" height=\"71\"></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f9UWsTm2svK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1320/856/smartstreamlabs-discord-png.png\" alt=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1320/856/smartstreamlabs-discord-png.png\" width=\"394\" height=\"115\"></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">加入&nbsp;Discord 伺服器！獲取專屬支援與更新通知。</span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">注意：此模組需要：</span> <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Create &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/949/796/638598725500886388.webp\" alt=\"create\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1432/101/line-png.png\" alt=\"line\" width=\"1280\" height=\"32\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">現已推出全新更新 173.46.45 版本</span></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1546/451/well_1-png.png\" alt=\"well\" width=\"910\" height=\"460\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1546/450/monster_room_1_optimized-png.png\" alt=\"room\" width=\"1843\" height=\"1150\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;在此下載：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Create 模組&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></a></h2>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">下載我們全新的 Create 模組！</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1082/284/256/256/638622594266642731.png\" alt=\"logo2\" width=\"95\" height=\"95\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-sky-village\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Sky Village</a> &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1082/284/256/256/638622594266642731.png\" alt=\"logo1\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">請在此查看 Create 的開發進度。您可由此得知我們何時會更新到更高版本。</span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1151/680/dev-png.png\" alt=\"create\" width=\"572\" height=\"1086\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">點擊</span><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"> </span><a href=\"https://github.com/Creators-of-Create/Create/wiki/dev.status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>這裡</strong></span> <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">查看 Create 官<strong>方&nbsp;</strong>開發進度！<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/949/796/638598725500886388.webp\" alt=\"create\" width=\"88\" height=\"88\"></span></a></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">別忘了前往我的個人頁面瀏覽其他模組！</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1432/101/line-png.png\" alt=\"line\" width=\"1280\" height=\"32\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/949/805/create-mod-minecraft.jpg\" alt=\"banner\" width=\"1200\" height=\"640\"></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1432/101/line-png.png\" alt=\"line\" width=\"1280\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/868/291/7.png\" alt=\"Create 標誌\" width=\"1023\" height=\"71\"></h2>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Create: Structures Arise</strong> </span><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">是一款 Forge 模組，將 <strong>Create</strong> 模組令人驚嘆的工程能力與散佈於《我的世界》世界中的動態自訂結構完美融合。本模組引入了由 Create 精密機械系統驅動的複雜互動結構，將探索轉化為一場令人興奮的冒險，自動化機具、謎題與機械奇蹟在每個角落靜候您的發掘。建造、探索並與這些先進結構互動，讓您的遊戲體驗邁向全新境界！</span></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1432/101/line-png.png\" alt=\"line\" width=\"1280\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">注意：</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">若遇到 Create 模組本身的錯誤，請前往 Create 模組官方頁面回報。<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://github.com/Creators-of-Create/Create/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create 問題追蹤</a></span></span></h1>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/868/293/9.png\" alt=\"show\" width=\"1023\" height=\"172\"></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/733/minecraft__forge_1.png\" alt=\"create boat\" width=\"2175\" height=\"1082\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1432/101/line-png.png\" alt=\"line\" width=\"1280\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/868/290/intellij-idea-icon-512x512-ksbwsbbn.png\" alt=\"intell\" width=\"182\" height=\"182\"></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">本模組使用 IntelliJ 開發</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">#廣告</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">產品免責聲明：本產品非《我的世界》官方產品。未經 Mojang 或 Microsoft 認可或與其關聯。</span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
